      "mergeID": "66acfe02d637bdff21ddf1fb",
      "mergedPostDetails": "on the latest vrchat beta using the latest virtual desktop beta, the index finger/trigger button on the right hand controller will not stay down. even when fully pressed, it can randomly oscillate to unpressed occasionally. This seems to be an issue on the gesture side of things, as I haven't experienced this issue interfering with any menu/laser interactions. animation transitions that do read the gestures are still affected though, which can cause a lot of annoying interactions with avatars. Both me and another user who also uses the quest 3 are experiencing the same issue, and both of us have confirmed it only happens when using the vrchat beta.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Quest 3 right index finger [trigger] won't stay down",
